ERRORS [status codes, causes, fixes]
deps=index.ctx

400  bad-request         malformed JSON or missing required field
                         fix: check body schema in relevant fragment

401  unauthorized        missing or invalid X-API-Key header
                         fix: set header X-API-Key: <your-key>

403  forbidden           action requires owner role (invite/delete workspace)
                         fix: use owner's API key

404  not-found           session expired, checkpoint deleted, or workspace not yours
                         session-fix: create new session via POST /sessions
                         checkpoint-fix: list via GET /checkpoints and restore valid one
                         workspace-fix: list via GET /workspaces

429  rate-limited        too many requests in 60s window
                         body: {limit:int, window:"1m", plan:str, upgrade:url}
                         fix: backoff and retry, or upgrade plan

507  storage-quota       checkpoint storage full for your plan
                         body: {used_mb:float, limit_mb:float}
                         fix: delete old checkpoints or upgrade plan

500  internal            worker process crashed or Python error
                         body: {error:str}   # contains Python traceback
                         fix: check code for syntax/runtime errors

# Common patterns
session-expired → re-create session, optionally restore from checkpoint
rate-limited    → exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s
quota-exceeded  → GET /checkpoints, DELETE old ones, retry
